WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:03.680
Let's look at how these labs
help you choose AI for your work.

2
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:08.821
We give every model the same real
UK work tasks for a fair comparison.

3
00:00:09.401 --> 00:00:14.761
Computer checks and AI judges mark
every answer, and no AI company pays us.

4
00:00:15.381 --> 00:00:18.881
Start with whichever of the six
labs is closest to your own work.

5
00:00:19.541 --> 00:00:22.762
This link opens the answers so
you can compare them yourself.

6
00:00:23.342 --> 00:00:27.902
The chart shows test costs and average
marks, not app subscription prices.

7
00:00:28.502 --> 00:00:32.062
Sort by cost, and the most
expensive tests move to the top.

8
00:00:32.682 --> 00:00:36.442
Then sort by score, and the
highest average marks come first.

9
00:00:36.962 --> 00:00:39.763
Back up at the lab cards,
open the research lab.

10
00:00:40.343 --> 00:00:44.923
Our picks show which model did best on
research tasks and a cheaper choice that

11
00:00:44.963 --> 00:00:46.623
caught every planted mistake.

12
00:00:47.143 --> 00:00:51.203
Here, you can judge four answers without
knowing which model wrote each one.

13
00:00:51.803 --> 00:00:54.864
Read the brief first, then
choose the answer you'd use.

14
00:00:55.384 --> 00:00:59.684
You'll see who wrote each answer, its
mark and whether it fell for the trap.

15
00:01:00.284 --> 00:01:04.104
Further down, compare marks in the
table of all the models we tested.

16
00:01:04.644 --> 00:01:08.224
Check for missed traps, then
compare what each task cost.

17
00:01:08.724 --> 00:01:12.345
Click on any model's Answer button
to read its response in full.

18
00:01:13.225 --> 00:01:15.645
Try the labs for free
and choose for yourself.
